# Windows scripts ship as committed: the .ps1 files are UTF-8 *with a BOM*
# (Windows PowerShell 5.1 decodes BOM-less UTF-8 as the ANSI codepage and
# mangles non-ASCII, which corrupted the setup banner). Treat them as binary
# so git never rewrites line endings or strips the BOM on clone or ZIP export.
*.ps1 -text
*.bat -text
